# Dividend — Symfony upgrade 6.4 → 8.1

## Project context

Trading/dividend tracking app. Symfony PHP framework 8.1, PHP 8.4+, Doctrine ORM, API Platform, Twig templates, Tailwind, UX bundles (ChartJS, Autocomplete, Turbo).

Namespace: `App\` → PSR-4 `src/`  
Test namespace: `App\Tests\` → `tests/`

Composer require: `"symfony": {"require": "8.1.*"}`  
PHP: `>=8.4`  
Config: `config/services.yaml`, YAML parameters via `%param.name%`

### GitLab / glab

`glab` is the CLI tool for GitLab. Use it for all GitLab interactions:

```bash
glab issue create     # create issue
glab issue list       # list open issues
glab issue view #N    # view issue details
glab mr create        # open merge request
glab mr view          # check MR status
glab mr approve       # approve an MR
glab ci list          # list CI pipelines
glab ci view          # view CI job details
```

See `.ai/skills/feature-workflow.md` for the full feature creation workflow.

